      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e63fa7b8552d7ab835dfee3c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To ignore a script from being included in a bundle (e.g. if it's unrelated to the parent script note), apply the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ label.",
      "sourceHash": "e63fa7b8552d7ab835dfee3ce1c2d4e6ffe976eac2829e75e6c0a24b77ed25e9",
      "context": "Script bundles > Ignoring a code script from a bundle",
      "contextHash": "490c5bfe3b11ed5f6b6d7fc1cfdf9e67763eea6e539ee886276fb85f0f1d339b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7f96ef6ee30708bbb3792e58_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Sharing a module across multiple bundles__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "7f96ef6ee30708bbb3792e58cf02422881ac9ca8af1548838ed43ddc7342c437",
      "context": "Script bundles > Sharing a module across multiple bundles",
      "contextHash": "bdcc9a1e93539d275480d195ea6c0e619d37572182d0ad38bcb79025b38f1a59",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7a72ab825b1e42f11436f6d5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Modules can be reused across multiple scripts by simply cloning the shared module between two modules (see __TRILIUM_PH_0__Cloning Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__).",
      "sourceHash": "7a72ab825b1e42f11436f6d50c15f4785246c46c17ee5cf49ef33d1d47e30001",
      "context": "Script bundles > Sharing a module across multiple bundles",
      "contextHash": "bdcc9a1e93539d275480d195ea6c0e619d37572182d0ad38bcb79025b38f1a59",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5aa75a9018dfb05c851acfc2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Optionally, a separate note can be used to contain all the different reusable modules for an easy way to discover them.",
      "sourceHash": "5aa75a9018dfb05c851acfc27e911dbf3b42bc03b09a4344c20ac17bca12db56",
      "context": "Script bundles > Sharing a module across multiple bundles",
      "contextHash": "bdcc9a1e93539d275480d195ea6c0e619d37572182d0ad38bcb79025b38f1a59",
      "status": "pending",
